sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W1 as worker 1: update title of doc d
    participant W2 as worker 2: update status of doc d
    participant R as regolith

    W1->>R: get_parts(d, filter and title parts)
    W2->>R: get_parts(d, filter and status parts)
    W1->>R: merge(d, operand touching title)
    W2->>R: merge(d, operand touching status)
    W1->>R: commit
    R-->>W1: committed
    W2->>R: commit
    Note over R: the newer operand touches title, not status: the projected read is still current
    R-->>W2: committed
    Note over W1,W2: both commit, the document holds both changes, no conflict and no lock
